Palm's Music (com.palm.app.musicplayer 3.0.8000), as installed on the reference TouchPad (webOS
CE 3.1.0, /media/cryptofs/apps), copied 2026-11-04 and here exactly as packaged.

HP released this app's source as part of its open-source webOS core apps, under the Apache
License 2.0; the TouchPad's copy matches that release but for line endings, appinfo.json
(without its requiredPermissions and trustLevel) and index.html (Enyo loaded with
launch="nobridge"). Copyright Hewlett-Packard Development Company, L.P., Apache License 2.0.

Lunacy answers what it asks for: the music library in db8 (card/MusicLibrary.kt, from
Android's media library), album art through extractfs. Its dashboard is also what the
Android Notifications app shows for an Android app that is playing.
